{{Quote|We're in the Moddell sector, right? How far to the Monsua Nebula?''"<br />"''A few light years.''"<br />"''Then we're in luck. I know a place.|Han Solo and [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]]|<ref name="Skywalker Strikes, Part V" />}}
The '''Moddell sector''' was a subsector of the [[Zuma sector]]<ref name="Galaxy">{{GalaxyMapAppendix}}</ref> in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]]. The subsector notably contained the [[Endor system]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> and the [[Monsua Nebula]].<ref name="Skywalker Strikes, Part V" /> The subsector was notoriously rife with [[Hyperspace anomaly|hyperspace anomalies]] that could dump [[starship]]s into the [[Endor system]] from as far away as [[Sanyassa]] and [[Zorbia]].<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> One such anomaly was the [[black hole]] known as the [[Endor Gate]].<ref name="S&S">''[[Starships and Speeders]]''</ref>

